# Copy to .env.production before `vite build`. NOT committed: it carries the
# token. The bundle that results carries it too — serve it only behind the
# operator's own login or VPN (backend README, "Production").
VITE_API_BASE=https://<backend host>
# The scraper owns /ingest (depth slots + capture config). A static build has no
# Vite proxy, so point this at the scraper's origin — or, if the backend reverse-
# proxies /ingest to the scraper, set it equal to VITE_API_BASE. Leave blank ONLY
# in dev (Vite proxies /ingest). Without it, /ingest hits the SPA host and BOOKS
# reads an empty book.
VITE_INGEST_BASE=https://<scraper host, or same as VITE_API_BASE>
VITE_SPREAD_API_TOKEN=<the backend's SPREAD_API_TOKEN>
